WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Hi, I just got nominated by Maurice Fallon

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:04.760
for an ALS Ice Bucket Challenge.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.680
So I accept the challenge, and in turn

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:10.220
I nominate A. Linssen, Michael Case,

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.860
and Ross Finman.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.000
[ominous music]

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.000
[scary violins]

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:05.660
[loud buzzing]

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.300
(robot voice) I nominate Professor John Leonard,

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:12.240
Professor Anantha Chandrakasan,

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:15.340
and the pathetic human victim's brother Eric Finman

